.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go
.Nd Reticulum network stack daemon and tools
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar command
.Op Ar flags
.Nm
.Cm daemon
.Nm
.Cm status | id | probe | path | slow | speedtest | dump | snapshot | cp | x | sh | pageserver | debug | self-check | zen | completion
.Op Ar flags
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a Go implementation of the Reticulum Network Stack.
A single binary provides the network daemon and operator tools as subcommands.
.Pp
With no command, or with
.Cm daemon ,
the process loads configuration from
.Pa ~/.reticulum-go/config
(created on first run) and runs as a shared-instance owner or client according
to that config.
.Pp
Legacy tool names
.Nm rgostatus , rgoid , rgoprobe , rgopath , rgocp , rgox , rnx ,
.Nm rgopageserver , rgoslow , rgospeed , rgodump , rgosnap ,
and
.Nm rgoselfcheck
may be installed as symlinks to this binary.
When invoked under those names, the matching subcommand is selected automatically.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width pageserver
.It Cm daemon
Run the network daemon (default).
.It Cm status
Interface and transport status via shared-instance RPC.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-status 1 .
.It Cm id
Identities, destination hashes, signing and encryption.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-id 1 .
.It Cm probe
Encrypted probe packets and RTT.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-probe 1 .
.It Cm path
Path table, drop, and blackhole management.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-path 1 .
.It Cm slow
Rank slow interfaces, paths, and transfer bottlenecks.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-slow 1 .
.It Cm speedtest
Link throughput smoke test (loopback, listen, or client).
See
.Xr reticulum-go-speedtest 1 .
.It Cm dump
Decode Reticulum packets from hex or pcap.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-dump 1 .
.It Cm snapshot
Path table, links, and health JSON over RPC.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-snapshot 1 .
.It Cm cp
File transfer over Reticulum links.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-cp 1 .
.It Cm x
Remote command execution over links (Python
.Nm rnx
interop).
See
.Xr reticulum-go-x 1 .
.It Cm sh
Interactive remote shell.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-sh 1 .
.It Cm git
Git-over-Reticulum node and remote helper.
.It Cm pageserver
NomadNet-style page and file server.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-pageserver 1 .
.It Cm debug
Effective config, rate table, and RPC diagnostics.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-debug 1 .
.It Cm self-check
Host OS preflight checklist.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-self-check 1 .
.It Cm zen
Scan Go and Python sources for path and link footguns.
.It Cm completion
Print bash, zsh, or fish completion scripts.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-completion 1 .
.El
.Sh FLAG PARSING
Most tools accept flags before, between, or after positional arguments. A literal
.Cm --
ends flag parsing. The remote command tools
.Cm sh
and
.Cm x
are different because positional text can belong to the remote command. After
their first positional argument, only multi-letter tool flags are parsed.
Single-letter arguments there belong to the remote command. Once remote command
text begins, every remaining argument belongs to the remote command.
.Pp
Tool
.Fl config
options accept either a config file or a directory. A directory uses the file
named config inside it.
.Sh GLOBAL OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--version"
.It Fl h , -help
Print help and exit.
.It Fl v , -version
Print version and exit.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.reticulum-go/storage/"
.It Pa ~/.reticulum-go/config
Default configuration file.
.It Pa ~/.reticulum-go/storage/
Identities, path table, and related state.
.El
